OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. There
OL,7,Fwill be scattered showers, these
OL,8,Fbecoming fewer later in the afternoon.
OL,9,FWindy with fresh occasionally strong
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening with
OL,13,Fjust the odd passing shower. Then the
OL,14,Frest of the night will be dry.
OL,15,FWesterly winds easing down, but
OL,16,Fremaining fresh along the north coast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,19,Fspread east during the morning,
OL,20,Fturning light and patchy from the west
OL,21,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
